stonedog-featuremap
Copyright 2026 StoneDogCode L.L.C.

This product defines the schema for a `feature-map.json` -- the document a
repository uses to declare which of its features exist and which code paths
implement them -- and validates a map against it.

It contains no feature maps of its own beyond the fixtures in `test/fixtures/`,
which are reduced, anonymised shapes written for the tests. A real map names a
private codebase's internal structure and is never published here.

